SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 11:33:45 and reappears at 12:34:03 EET\, se
 en from Tripoli\, LY.\nThe Moon is 15° up in the ESE · daylight\, Sun +5
 4°.\nTimes for the Moon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view 
 at the Moon's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=32.8874&
 lon=13.1873
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=32.8874&lon=13.1873
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
